        "ResetPassword": {
            "Subject": "Reset your password for FitTracker",
            "Body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang='en'>\n<head>\n  <meta charset='UTF-8'>\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0'>\n  <title>Password Reset</title>\n  <link rel='stylesheet' href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200&icon_names=lock_reset'/>\n  <style>\n    .material-symbols-outlined { font-family: 'Material Symbols Outlined'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 48px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; word-wrap: normal; direction: ltr; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; padding: 20px; }\n    .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #1e293b; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n    .email-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2563eb 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }\n    .logo-icon { color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 56px; }\n    .email-header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .email-header p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); font-size: 14px; }\n    .email-body { padding: 40px 30px; }\n    .email-body p { margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; }\n    .email-body strong { color: #ffffff; }\n    .cta-button { display: inline-block; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .cta-button:hover { background-color: #60a5fa; }\n    .button-container { text-align: center; }\n    .divider { height: 1px; background-color: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.5); margin: 30px 0; }\n    .info-box { background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .info-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; }\n    .security-notice { background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .security-notice p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; }\n    .email-footer { background-color: #0f172a; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.5); }\n    .email-footer p { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .email-footer a { color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none; }\n    @media (max-width: 600px) { .email-container { border-radius: 0; } .email-header { padding: 30px 20px; } .email-header h1 { font-size: 24px; } .email-body { padding: 30px 20px; } .email-footer { padding: 20px; } }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class='email-container'>\n    <div class='email-header'>\n      <div class='logo-icon'><span class='material-symbols-outlined'>lock_reset</span></div>\n      <h1>Password Reset</h1>\n      <p>We received a request to reset your password</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class='email-body'>\n      <p>Hello <strong>{0}</strong>,</p>\n      <p>We received a request to reset the password for your FitTracker account. If you made this request, click the button below to create a new password.</p>\n      <p>This password reset link will be valid for <strong>1 hour</strong> for security purposes.</p>\n      <div class='button-container'>\n        <a href='{1}' class='cta-button'>Reset Password</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class='divider'></div>\n      <div class='security-notice'>\n        <p><strong>Security tip:</strong> Choose a strong password that you don't use for other accounts. We recommend using a combination of letters, numbers, and special characters.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='info-box'>\n        <p><strong>Didn't request this?</strong> If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.</p>\n      </div>\n      <p style='font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 30px;'>\n        If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n        <a href='{1}' style='color: #3b82f6; word-break: break-all;'>{1}</a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class='email-footer'>\n      <p><strong>Need help?</strong> Contact our support team at <a href='mailto:support@fittracker.com'>support@fittracker.com</a></p>\n      <p>© 2025 FitTracker. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
